type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> Although I can't make my DualShock 4 vibrate on Android, I tried controller vibration apps on Google Play \n\nhttps://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=uk.co.powgames.gamecondiag\n\nI tried this app on my Chromebook Android 13, my 3 gamepads did not vibrate (via USB cable), according to the information this app is supposed to use SDL. This app displays up to 4 vibrators, but for 2 it says that the vibrator is unavailable; for 2 vibrators that should be available, nothing happens.\n\n--------\n\n`For Android, joypad vibration is not supported due to OS restrictions.`\n\nI think we can leave this notice as is for now; it could also be due to the Android version or some extra permissions. I believe `NVIDIA SHIELD Android TV Pro` uses Android 9.","created_at":"2026-01-24T09:54:27Z","updated_at":"2026-01-24T09:54:27Z","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114895#discussion_r2723950080","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114895","_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2723950080"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114895#discussion_r2723950080"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114895"}},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2723950080/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"start_line":null,"original_start_line":null,"start_side":null,"line":null,"original_line":220,"side":"RIGHT","in_reply_to_id":2687672461,"author_association":"MEMBER","original_position":27,"position":1,"subject_type":"line"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments/2824530688","pull_request_review_id":3822307035,"id":2824530688,"node_id":"PRRC_kwDOAO6SJc6oWusA","diff_hunk":"@@ -211,8 +213,9 @@ class Input : public Object {\n