rong_magnitude] is the strength of the strong motor (between 0 and 1). [param duration] is the duration of the effect in seconds (a duration of 0 will try to play the vibration indefinitely). The vibration can be stopped early by calling [method stop_joy_vibration].\n-\t\t\t\t[b]Note:[/b] Not every hardware is compatible with long effect durations; it is recommended to restart an effect if it has to be played for more than a few seconds.\n+\t\t\t\tStarts to vibrate the joypad. See also [method has_joy_vibration] and [method is_joy_vibrating].\n+\t\t\t\tJoypads usually come with two rumble motors, a strong and a weak one.\n+\t\t\t\t[param weak_magnitude] is the strength of the weak motor (between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]).\n+\t\t\t\t[param strong_magnitude] is the strength of the strong motor (between [code]0.0[/code] and [code]1.0[/code]).\n+\t\t\t\t[param duration] is the duration of the effect in seconds (a duration of [code]0.0[/code] will try to play the vibration indefinitely).","path":"doc/classes/Input.xml","commit_id":"3326ad9e9f0f1a81797288410dfd86ebdac1b3a4","original_commit_id":"3326ad9e9f0f1a81797288410dfd86ebdac1b3a4","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.c